# 统一 Git 行尾与换行符处理，避免 Windows (CRLF) 与 Linux CI (LF) 之间互相改写。
* text=auto

*.java text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.jks binary
*.jar binary